    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover Secrets, Forge Alliances, and Defy Fate in Vaulted Valor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/1ab65387a69d638566c3af6d4c59aee2.poster.avif?t=1735408474\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/1ab65387a69d638566c3af6d4c59aee2.webm?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/1ab65387a69d638566c3af6d4c59aee2.mp4?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in an underground vault designed to protect humanity, you discover that survival comes at a cost. In Vaulted Valor, a narrative-driven post-apocalyptic RPG, every choice matters as you navigate a world of intrigue, sabotage, and hidden agendas. Will you unite the vault\u2019s inhabitants to confront its dark truths, or will the fractures within tear it apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/ae7c9dd329773e86ff4c24214de44f55.poster.avif?t=1735408474\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/ae7c9dd329773e86ff4c24214de44f55.webm?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/ae7c9dd329773e86ff4c24214de44f55.mp4?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Vault:</strong> Delve into a sprawling underground society with richly detailed environments and layered mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Path:</strong> Shape your story through meaningful choices that impact alliances, outcomes, and your role in the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Characters:</strong> Meet a cast of complex NPCs, each with their own secrets, motivations, and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Solve puzzles, engage in mini-games, and navigate tense moral dilemmas that push your decisions to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Truth:</strong> Investigate a hidden conspiracy threatening the survival of everyone in the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/abfe3bc48dfd57505b9a17029466b630.poster.avif?t=1735408474\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/abfe3bc48dfd57505b9a17029466b630.webm?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/abfe3bc48dfd57505b9a17029466b630.mp4?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Vaulted Valor and decide: Will you rise as a hero, or will the weight of the vault\u2019s secrets crush you?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover Secrets, Forge Alliances, and Defy Fate in Vaulted Valor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/1ab65387a69d638566c3af6d4c59aee2.poster.avif?t=1735408474\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/1ab65387a69d638566c3af6d4c59aee2.webm?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/1ab65387a69d638566c3af6d4c59aee2.mp4?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in an underground vault designed to protect humanity, you discover that survival comes at a cost. In Vaulted Valor, a narrative-driven post-apocalyptic RPG, every choice matters as you navigate a world of intrigue, sabotage, and hidden agendas. Will you unite the vault\u2019s inhabitants to confront its dark truths, or will the fractures within tear it apart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/ae7c9dd329773e86ff4c24214de44f55.poster.avif?t=1735408474\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/ae7c9dd329773e86ff4c24214de44f55.webm?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/ae7c9dd329773e86ff4c24214de44f55.mp4?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Vault:</strong> Delve into a sprawling underground society with richly detailed environments and layered mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Path:</strong> Shape your story through meaningful choices that impact alliances, outcomes, and your role in the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Characters:</strong> Meet a cast of complex NPCs, each with their own secrets, motivations, and quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Solve puzzles, engage in mini-games, and navigate tense moral dilemmas that push your decisions to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Truth:</strong> Investigate a hidden conspiracy threatening the survival of everyone in the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/abfe3bc48dfd57505b9a17029466b630.poster.avif?t=1735408474\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/abfe3bc48dfd57505b9a17029466b630.webm?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417600/extras/abfe3bc48dfd57505b9a17029466b630.mp4?t=1735408474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Vaulted Valor and decide: Will you rise as a hero, or will the weight of the vault\u2019s secrets crush you?</p>",
